        <mxCell id="n23" value="5 main actors: Author, Reviewer / Approver, Platform Administrator, Operations / SRE, Decision Consumer / Client Application.&#10;4 supporting actors: Identity Provider / IAM, CI/CD &amp; Automation, Observability Platform, Audit / SIEM.&#10;Platform User provides only common account/read capabilities. External System grants no shared API permissions. Operations does not inherit Administrator." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
